#==============================================================================================
#
#   readable_stream - Streams::ReadableStream: a stream's slots and the operations other
#   specifications call (get a reader, tee, close, error, enqueue, byte reading support)
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Streams/ReadableStream.cpp (lines 1-433) and the inline members
#       of ReadableStream.h, as the ReadableStream stand-in of DESIGN.md §3.6 (region p2s): what
#       fetch bodies need of byte streams. The JS-facing members (the constructor from an
#       underlying source, ReadableStream.from, locked, cancel, getReader, pipeThrough, pipeTo,
#       transferring) and default controllers are phase 4; a path that reaches one traps.
#
#       Copyright (c) 2022, Linus Groh <linusg@serenityos.org>
#       Copyright (c) 2023-2024, Shannon Booth <shannon@serenityos.org>
#       Copyright (c) 2024, Kenneth Myhra <kennethmyhra@serenityos.org>
